# Tool versions for the CI gates: one KEY=VALUE per line.
# CI copies these lines into each job's step outputs; nothing sources or
# executes this file. Dependabot does not read it.
# The weekly freshness report lists the tools that are behind (not the SDK and
# CRT lines).
# A bump is a pull request that changes one line (and its _SHA256 line) to a
# release at least 7 days old; a tool installed through install-action must be
# in the manifest of the pinned install-action commit.
# XWIN_SDK_VERSION and XWIN_CRT_VERSION select the Windows SDK and CRT that
# cargo xwin downloads and builds against.
# scripts/ci-check.sh parses it and compares each tool's version.
# scripts/build.sh reads XWIN_SDK_VERSION and XWIN_CRT_VERSION and exports them.
CARGO_XWIN=0.23.1
CARGO_DENY=0.20.2
CARGO_LLVM_COV=0.9.1
ZIZMOR=1.30.1
TYPOS=1.50.1
GITLEAKS=8.30.1
GITLEAKS_SHA256=551f6fc83ea457d62a0d98237cbad105af8d557003051f41f3e7ca7b3f2470eb
ACTIONLINT=1.7.12
ACTIONLINT_SHA256=8aca8db96f1b94770f1b0d72b6dddcb1ebb8123cb3712530b08cc387b349a3d8
XWIN_SDK_VERSION=10.0.26100
XWIN_CRT_VERSION=14.44.17.14
